/**
 * selftest.ts — attack every guarantee (R-053). One `ok` line per guarantee; exit non-zero on
 * any failure. Runs hooks and the CLI as REAL subprocesses against a temp fixture project in
 * test mode (stub judge), with NEMESIS_HOME_OVERRIDE so no real daemon or token is touched.
 *
 * Test names are the strings `prd/TRACE.json` cites — change one and the trace gate fails.
 */
